# AI Studio Update Prompt: Ultra-Premium 3D Incoming Call Popup

Upgrade my existing Call App's incoming call notification to the exact ultra-premium 3D floating incoming call popup implemented in the reference code below.

### Integration Instructions
1. Keep all my existing call logic, incoming call listeners, ringtone/audio handlers, and caller data intact.
2. Adapt the HTML/CSS/JS below to my project's framework (React / Vite / HTML / WebView) while preserving:
   - The exact visual design (smoked-sapphire frosted glass, animated liquid-platinum conic-gradient rim, subtle emerald left wing & crimson right wing glow).
   - The 3-stage 3D animation: **68px circular avatar orb drop** (`rotateX` + spring bounce) → **center-to-sides 76px pill unfold** with center-seam glint → **drag-ready** with pulsing directional chevrons.
   - Smooth Pointer Event sideways drag physics: **Green (Left)** dragged **rightward** to answer, **Red (Right)** dragged **leftward** to decline, **55% threshold** with luminous glass trails + tick/haptic feedback, elastic snap-back if released early, and tap-to-nudge `"DRAG SIDEWAYS"` hint.
   - The **Active "On Call" Bar** (avatar with emerald halo, caller name, pulsing green dot, live timer `00:00`, mini waveform, Mute, Speaker, and glossy 3D Red End Call button).
   - The **Collapse-to-Orb Exit** animation (collapses both sides back into the 68px circular orb, then retracts upward off the top of the screen).
3. Connect the hooks (`onAnswerCall`, `onDeclineCall`, `onEndCall`, `onToggleMute`, `onToggleSpeaker`) and dynamic `caller` data (`name`, `initials`, `subtitle`) directly to my existing Call App state.

